# The main menu's other screens, each entered with A and left with B (docs/port/SYNTH.md 2): its second to fifth
# options (states 0x2000, 0x200, 0x800 and 0x1000), then back on the main menu.
# until: 0x10:900
# visits: 0x2000 0x200 0x800 0x1000
# seconds: 120
# expect: state=0x00000010: players 1, windows 1
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt; the main menu from 8 s
10 DOWN 0.1    # its second option
11 A
14 B           # back
16 DOWN 0.1    # the third
17 A
20 B
22 DOWN 0.1    # the fourth
23 A
26 B
28 DOWN 0.1    # the fifth
29 A
32 B
